{"steam_appid":3745310,"steam_name":"DEADLINE DELIVERY","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3745310/1928079982/6cf2eb6f0412400d51019fd6812bac515592c78b/1777014497/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1777015151","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257140097/bef2267cde85bd27dc8da697e862ae12c0d9dd37/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1777015151","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/eb19754686ea3456115f89ddae8184af57bfc8fc/ss_eb19754686ea3456115f89ddae8184af57bfc8fc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785900782","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/33549cd502e06826ed1dbbd19f3a4b82f040749d/ss_33549cd502e06826ed1dbbd19f3a4b82f040749d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785900782","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/da9dbd34c2a35b7376215e9d3082f1271ceff3e0/ss_da9dbd34c2a35b7376215e9d3082f1271ceff3e0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785900782","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/c568f171409726e28eb3e0f8d624e480dc1011f8/ss_c568f171409726e28eb3e0f8d624e480dc1011f8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785900782","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/3e479d4717ff33f8bde52b71f69d9638c9346f68/ss_3e479d4717ff33f8bde52b71f69d9638c9346f68.1920x1080.jpg?t=1785900782"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/ad27493e78778d5f5de44678b729589b.webp?t=1785900782\" width=457 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your truck is <i>fast</i>, <strong>unstable</strong>, and always on the edge of spinning out. Play as Carl, a monkey mailman who's been late on his deliveries. Fed up with your missed deadlines, your boss has rigged your truck with explosives... and the timer's already ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/e4d33c69c352128f309e8abb35df16d5.webp?t=1785900782\" width=214 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your job is simple... deliver the mail across 21 unique maps before time runs out.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/26318db873ec13a6a04db9bda986035b.poster.avif?t=1785900782\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/26318db873ec13a6a04db9bda986035b.webm?t=1785900782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/26318db873ec13a6a04db9bda986035b.mp4?t=1785900782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/4b0461e6f110e36ff395fad5e1e7f075.webp?t=1785900782\" width=210 height=27 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with up to 8 players in a time-attack race — invite friends or match with other players!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/56424d88e29f5accd9fc484079eebc31.poster.avif?t=1785900782\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/56424d88e29f5accd9fc484079eebc31.webm?t=1785900782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/56424d88e29f5accd9fc484079eebc31.mp4?t=1785900782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/1304732314055aa6547b0041980cc254.webp?t=1785900782\" width=126 height=28 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pull off flips, dodge obstacles, and beat the clock — or explode trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/12783ea3ad32183013f914c8ea14d421.poster.avif?t=1785900782\" width=800 height=208 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/12783ea3ad32183013f914c8ea14d421.webm?t=1785900782\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/12783ea3ad32183013f914c8ea14d421.mp4?t=1785900782\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3745310/extras/1b11a7b252663ac223eaff55072cd1b8.avif?t=1785900782\" width=1024 height=212 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2400, AMD FX-4100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 780 Ti or AMD Radeon R9 290X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul cl